  "schema_version": "numek.cg4_verification_manifest/1.0",
  "scope": "Five simpler baselines use shared typed transforms/frozen decoders/native reducers and one-gate S selection; native full-shortlist union is separate. Four reduced development workflows and one 40000-row curved workflow completed, retaining weaker native first-gate cases. Full-size development predates the added S-evidence parity assertion; a fresh reduced workflow established exact native S parity. Three geometry/protocol/exact-binomial references passed; the affected qualification-tooling group passed 14 (overlapping individual checks). Qualification uses fresh 180000..180039 across four families with 20 predeclared Bonferroni order-statistic median intervals; no superiority or controlled relative efficiency presumed. Remaining four original recovery anchors are queued after the existing partial-null slot; all original criteria/seeds/profiles remain unchanged. No runtime product learner, statistical guarantee, general execution framework, complete qualification or milestone completion is added."
